Begin3
Title:           XD Pascal
Version:         0.7.12
Entered-date:    2019-07-06
Description:     small educational Pascal compiler
Summary:	 XD Pascal is a small educational compiler for a subset of the Pascal language. A native x86 machine code generator directly emits COM executables for MS-DOS. The compiler supports VGA graphics, floating-point arithmetic, etc. 32-bit Pascal source is provided. Requires Win-32. See the XDPC fork.
Keywords:        pas turbo pascal xdp xdpc
Author:          Vasiliy Tereshkov
Primary-site:    https://github.com/vtereshkov/xdp
Platforms:       DOS
Copying-policy:  Public Domain
End
